TrueVoiceDroid — NOTICE
=========================

This build embeds the TruVoice speech synthesis tables and engine code
described below. It is a personal build, not for redistribution.

1. Engine data — Centigram Communications Corporation
-----------------------------------------------------
The constant tables the TruVoice engines read (letter-to-sound rules,
exception dictionary and suffix tables, phoneme inventory, per-phoneme
formant/duration/amplitude tables, prosody and duration-by-rate tables,
and the parameters defining the twenty voices) are lifted byte for byte
out of Centigram's binaries, whose copyright notice reads
"Copyright (c) 1991-1997 Centigram Communications Corp."
Centigram sold the TruVoice text-to-speech technology in June 1997;
where the rights sit now has not been established. The tables are used
here for personal, non-commercial purposes only.

