3. Pronunciation dictionary — IBM TTS dictionary (community profile)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
Whole-word respellings in assets/dictionary.tsv and stress fixes in
assets/lexicon.tsv derive from the IBM TTS dictionary triage behind the
Eloquence NVDA add-on community profile, via the iTruVoice project's
machine-verified tables.

4. Rate/clarity extensions
--------------------------
Above 253 wpm the engine shortens durations (OpenTV extension), and
formant bandwidths widen with rate (technique from Tamas Geczy's
TGSpeechBox, MIT). The originals' 46-253 wpm behavior is untouched.
